cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "HADES — Holistic AI-based Drug-likeness Estimation Score"
abstract: >-
  A soft-voting ensemble of five machine learning models that integrates ADMET
  and physicochemical properties to predict the oral drug-likeness of a
  molecule from its SMILES string.
message: "If you use HADES, please cite the article under preferred-citation."
